---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="RedGesta"
  subtitle="A modern educational platform integrating a legacy third-party API with a local Laravel application and database."
  eyebrow="Confidential Project · Case Study"
  stack={['Laravel', 'Docker', 'MySQL', 'API Integration', 'Linux']}
  confidential={true}
>
  <div class="case-grid">
    <article class="case-panel">
      <h2>Problem</h2>
      <p>
        The platform needed to present course and institution information through a modern
        interface while the operational backend remained owned by an external provider.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="case-panel">
      <h2>Data Strategy</h2>
      <p>
        Structural data is synchronized locally for reliable pages and search. Volatile data,
        such as pricing and promotions, is retrieved at runtime because the external provider
        remains the source of truth.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="case-panel">
      <h2>Implementation</h2>
      <p>
        The project includes a Laravel frontend/backend, Docker deployment, local persistence,
        full synchronization through Artisan, search, lead forms and production infrastructure.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</CaseStudyLayout>
